\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Descriptive UKF-minus-hybrid margins and two-repeat resampling envelope in the reference benchmark. \(\Delta \) is UKF \(\texttt  {final\_ler}\) minus Hybrid-\(b\) \(\texttt  {final\_ler}\). Positive values indicate lower hybrid error; all four scenario rows have \(2/2\) positive paired deltas. The envelope and final scale column are descriptive data readouts, not confidence intervals, \(p\)-values, standard errors, robustness proof or expanded-benchmark evidence.}}{20}{table.caption.15}\protected@file@percent }
